        },
        {
          "text": " Ahakuba Kristo tarataahire mu mwanya ogurikwera ogwakozirwe abantu, ogurikushushanisibwa nk'ogwo ogw'amazima, kureka akataaha omu iguru buzima ngu ayeyorekye hati omu maisho ga Ruhanga ahabwaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.24",
